{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>IBM第三季度業績好過市場預期，並上調全年自由現金流預測。</p><p></p><p>季內純利21.9億美元，按年增長兩成半。經調整每股攤薄盈利2.95美元，較預期多9美仙。收入171億美元，較預期多近3億美元。以固定匯率計，料全年收入增長百分之4至5，自由現金流將按年增加，超過10億美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T23:59:00.067012+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T22:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T01:38:02.030627+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T23:56:08.800006+00:00","content_hash":"5b4135e20847ac7a5c8d222a33b53c95595c93837af52562f6bee440408344f9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}